Package: ggpaintrbook
Title: The ggpaintr Book (dependency manifest only)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Not a real package. This DESCRIPTION exists only so CI and
    renv can resolve the packages the book's examples depend on, mirroring
    the convention used by the ggplot2 book repository. The Remotes line
    pins ggpaintr to a specific SHA; do not point it at a moving target
    (a branch name without an @sha is rejected by Rscript dev/book-gate.R).
